(14.2 Energy in Simple Harmonic Motion) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
T*
T*
(In simple harmonic motion kinetic energy and potential energy continuously exchange.) Tj
T*
(The total mechanical energy of the oscillator is E = 1/2 k A^2.) Tj
T*
(Because there is no friction, the total energy remains constant.) Tj
T*
ET
