(14.3 The Simple Pendulum) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
T*
T*
(A simple pendulum consists of a point mass suspended from a light string of length L.) Tj
T*
(For small angles the motion is approximately simple harmonic.) Tj
T*
(The period of a simple pendulum for small angles is T = 2 pi sqrt\(L/g\).) Tj
T*
ET
